 "gaps": [
  "attenuation is a Babylon range cut at 1/32 of the polynomial (a0 1 0 0 means no fall-off), not X_ITE's per pixel polynomial",
  "global=FALSE scope uses includedOnlyMeshes of the parent group; compared in our body only",
